From: MeiChia Chiu <meichia.chiu@mediatek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: clear EHT support when starting a non-EHT AP

Clear the EHT support flag together with the beamforming flags when AP
settings contain no EHT capabilities, so a reused link configuration does
not retain EHT support from an earlier AP start.

Signed-off-by: MeiChia Chiu <meichia.chiu@mediatek.com>

--- a/net/mac80211/cfg.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/cfg.c
@@ -1394,6 +1394,7 @@
 		link_conf->eht_su_beamformer = false;
 		link_conf->eht_su_beamformee = false;
 		link_conf->eht_mu_beamformer = false;
+		link_conf->eht_support = false;
 	}
 
 	if (sdata->vif.type == NL80211_IFTYPE_AP &&
